cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite the archived version used in your work."
type: software
title: "Streamflow Alteration Index (SAI) calculation tools"
version: 1.0.0
authors:
  - family-names: Shen
    given-names: Hongren
    affiliation: University of Waterloo
repository-code: "https://github.com/hongren-shen/streamflow-alteration-index"
url: "https://github.com/hongren-shen/streamflow-alteration-index"
license: MIT
abstract: >-
  Python tools for calculating the Streamflow Alteration Index (SAI) from
  Ontario Lake and River Routing Product (OLRRP) networks and alteration
  signal tables. The workflow calculates SAI_I and SAI_II for subbasins and
  attaches the results to river reaches. A southeastern Ontario (SE) example
  includes routing inputs, signal records, and reference outputs.
keywords:
  - Streamflow Alteration Index
  - hydrology
  - river networks
  - Ontario
  - OLRRP
